  "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
 ShowStringCharacters->False,
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"50b5e550-a85f-994a-914c-d5e382e6cb36"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["21. Reproducible execution order", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"c421a848-891d-a546-bd6a-5b0c1db11ed0"],

Cell["Run the notebook sections in this order:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b5cdca48-d3e0-d246-91ba-0e8e8cd78397"],

Cell["1. Setup", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2a0eb67b-6d34-f144-b9c8-cceea5c18149"],

Cell["2. Formal axiomatization", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ffbcdd02-4744-8b49-81ea-762f521695e9"],

Cell["3. Variational derivation", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"bab059c2-b266-dc43-9889-ad5d29be25e0"],

Cell["4. Consistency review", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0afe8c78-89de-564d-a61d-d46619be015e"],

Cell["5. Hessian and linearization", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9be565ed-4a40-0f47-922a-f474a87cd520"],

Cell["6. Numerical verification", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"97b7d544-7d91-f049-bc3f-1dfcbf919104"],

Cell["7. Measurement construction", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"94391922-d104-4e42-af64-11d383fd0f4a"],

Cell["8. Internal theorem-style checks", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"49945bf1-268c-3346-a79a-f9c6d2da382d"],

Cell["9. Review passes I--V", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7e8d2bdf-8b8c-8641-a4cc-20ae7d546c7a"],

Cell["10. Final conclusions ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"24600dd7-ba29-da44-8881-77c095854a15"],

